"Off by default. Converts only coordinates sent to the device; saved places and GPX remain unchanged. Use WGS-84 → GCJ-02 or BD-09 only when the destination expects that system. For a GCJ-02 map pin sent to GPS, use GCJ-02 → WGS-84. Stop spoofing before changing this setting. Coverage uses an approximate China bounding box; leave it off elsewhere, including border areas." = "默认关闭。仅转换发送给设备的坐标，不修改已保存地点和 GPX。仅当接收端需要对应坐标系时，才选择 WGS-84 → GCJ-02 或 BD-09。若地图标记为 GCJ-02、需发送至 GPS，则选择 GCJ-02 → WGS-84。更改前请停止模拟定位。转换采用近似的中国区域矩形范围；其他地区及边界附近请保持关闭。";
